        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One -- or two -- players control New York City's mayoral candidate, Zohran Mamdani, in a story-driven and snake-inspired arcade game!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven unique areas of New York and get to know  New Yorkers who live there: Inwood, Harlem, Central Park, Times Square, West Village, Chinatown, and Wall Street</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover documents inspired by real life events that tell the story of New York during the 2025 Mayoral Race</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend to play &quot;Socialist Mode&quot; where two players share controls and take turns guiding Zohran (local-coop only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form the longest line of supporters you can while dodging misinformation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop off supporters at the bus stop before you run out of stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard controls with WASD and arrow keys</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction for entertainment purposes produced and developed by Antifun Bloc. 100% of proceeds go to Antifun Bloc and the development team behind the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains satirical and parodic content referencing public figures and recognizable imagery for commentary and entertainment purposes only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All third-party materials, names, or likenesses are used transformatively and fall within fair use principles within U.S. law. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No endorsement or affiliation with any third parties including Zohran Mamdani or his campaign is implied. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All assets are original or properly licensed, and the developer will promptly remove or modify any element identified as infringing upon valid third-party rights.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One -- or two -- players control New York City's mayoral candidate, Zohran Mamdani, in a story-driven and snake-inspired arcade game!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven unique areas of New York and get to know  New Yorkers who live there: Inwood, Harlem, Central Park, Times Square, West Village, Chinatown, and Wall Street</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover documents inspired by real life events that tell the story of New York during the 2025 Mayoral Race</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend to play &quot;Socialist Mode&quot; where two players share controls and take turns guiding Zohran (local-coop only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form the longest line of supporters you can while dodging misinformation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop off supporters at the bus stop before you run out of stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard controls with WASD and arrow keys</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction for entertainment purposes produced and developed by Antifun Bloc. 100% of proceeds go to Antifun Bloc and the development team behind the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains satirical and parodic content referencing public figures and recognizable imagery for commentary and entertainment purposes only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All third-party materials, names, or likenesses are used transformatively and fall within fair use principles within U.S. law. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No endorsement or affiliation with any third parties including Zohran Mamdani or his campaign is implied. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All assets are original or properly licensed, and the developer will promptly remove or modify any element identified as infringing upon valid third-party rights.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "One -- or two -- players control New York City's mayoral candidate, Zohran Mamdani, in a story-driven and snake-inspired arcade game! Explore seven neighborhoods, uncover corruption, and challenge yourselves in local co-op &quot;Socialist Mode.&quot;",
